1	/**
2	 * Seed the GameMod catalog — the mod/plugin database customers browse and one-click
3	 * install onto their game servers.
4	 *
5	 * Run:  npx tsx prisma/seed-gamemods.ts    (idempotent — upserts on [gameFamily, slug])
